A fenced block quote is the block quote written another way

```
::: >
Notes:

- ship the parser
- then the renderer
:::
.
<blockquote>
  <p>Notes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>ship the parser</li>
    <li>then the renderer</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
::: >
Carol
::: >
Bob
:::
:::
.
<blockquote>
  <p>Carol</p>
  <blockquote><p>Bob</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
:::>
x
:::
.
<p>:::&gt;
x
:::</p>
```
